  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fundamentals first - Active engagement for Rule of Law - Annual Work Programme 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is consolidation of the operational capacities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;of the Helsinki Committee for Human Rights in the area of democracy and rule of law by 2025, particularly in fundamental rights in light with the EU accession process of the country.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives are: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1) To further consolidate internal and external governance and structural mechanisms of the Helsinki Committee for Human Rights; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;2) To provide structured evidence- based input in the area of fundamental rights within the context of EU accession, particularly Cluster I &#xbf; Fundamentals and &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3) To strengthen engagement of constituencies through public policy advocacy&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
